<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 7.5 POINTS TO 747.2 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 7.5 POINTS TO 747.2 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 7.5 points, or 0.99 percent, on Monday to 747.2, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the investment fund index losing the most, down 33.3 points, or 2.92 percent, to 1,107.6 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
